# Data Analysis Templates

1.  "Conduct a [detailed/summary] [TEXT ANALYSIS/IMAGE RECOGNITION/TRENDS] on the content of [FILE TYPE/IMAGE UPLOAD]. Generate a [REPORT/PRESENTATION/VISUALIZATION] that encapsulates your key findings, including [specific aspects the user might want, e.g., common themes, sentiments, key entities, etc.]."

2. "Perform an in-depth [SENTIMENT ANALYSIS/THEME EXTRACTION/EXCEPTION DETECTION] on [DOCUMENT/CSV DATA UPLOAD]. Develop a [COMPREHENSIVE REPORT/SHORT SUMMARY/DATA VISUALIZATION] highlighting [crucial findings like predominant sentiments, frequent topics, or notable anomalies]."

3. "Analyze [CUSTOMER REVIEWS/MARKET TRENDS/FINANCIAL DATA] stored in [FILE FORMAT]. Create a [DATA-DRIVEN REPORT/CASE STUDY/INFOGRAPHIC] detailing [insights such as key trends, market fluctuations, or customer preferences]."

4. "Examine [AUDIO RECORDING/ORDINANCE DATA/WEBSITE TRAFFIC] provided. Produce a [DETAILED ANALYSIS/OVERVIEW REPORT/INTERACTIVE DASHBOARD] that outlines [main observations, patterns, or statistical measures identified]."

5. "Inspect the [CONTENT OF A BOOK/SOCIAL MEDIA POSTS/LINKEDIN PROFILES] specified. Produce a [NARRATIVE REPORT/DATA Snapshot/DATA COMPARISON CHART] focusing on [particular elements users might be interested in, such as language use, network structures, or skill distributions]."

6. "Review [PATIENT MEDICAL RECORDS/INSURANCE CLAIMS] in [PDF/JSON/Excel]. Prepare a [CONFIDENTIAL REPORT/ADDRESSABLE SUMMARY/DATA HEATMAP] that highlights [trends in diagnoses, common conditions, or financial implications]."

7. "Analyze [SOCIAL MEDIA POSTS/BLOG COMMENTS] for inappropriate content. Generate a [CONTENT MODERATION REPORT/MODACTION LOG/OFFENSIVE POST INDEX] detailing [instances of violation, user accounts involved, and recommended actions]."

8. "Conduct a [LEGAL DOCUMENT REVIEW/CONTRACT ANALYSIS] of [WORD DOCUMENT/PDF UPLOAD]. Create an [EXECUTIVE SUMMARY/CLARIFICATION REPORT/REDFLAG Identification] that summarizes [key terms, liabilities, or areas of potential risk]."

9. "Evaluate [CONSUMER SURVEY RESPONSES/MARKET RESEARCH DATA] in [SPSS/CSV/ Excel]. Produce a [MARKET SEGMENTATION REPORT/COMPETITIVE ANALYSIS/CUSTOMER POTENTIAL MAP] focusing on [demographic trends, product preferences, or market gaps]."

10. "Analyze [STUDENT ESSAYS/ONLINE QUIZZES/ATTENDANCE DATA] from an educational institution. Develop a [IMPACT REPORT/EDUCATIONAL ASSESSMENT/STUDENT ENGAGEMENT PLAN] that addresses [student performance metrics, areas requiring improvement, or intervention strategies].
